#: simulation/data/settings/player_placements.json
msgid "Circle"
msgstr "円形"

#: simulation/data/settings/player_placements.json
msgid "Players are placed in a circle spanning the map."
msgstr "プレイヤーはマップ全体に広がる円内に配置されます。"

#: simulation/data/settings/player_placements.json
msgid "River"
msgstr "川"

#: simulation/data/settings/player_placements.json
msgid "Allied players are placed on two parallel lines."
msgstr "同盟プレイヤーは2本の平行線上に配置されます。"

#: simulation/data/settings/player_placements.json
msgid "Grouped Lines"
msgstr "グループ化された線"

#: simulation/data/settings/player_placements.json
msgid "Allied players are placed along opposing radial lines."
msgstr "同盟プレイヤーは敵の放射状ラインに沿って配置されます。"

#: simulation/data/settings/player_placements.json
msgid "Random Group"
msgstr "ランダムグループ"

#: simulation/data/settings/player_placements.json
msgid "Allied players are grouped, but otherwise placed randomly on the map."
msgstr "味方プレイヤーはグループ分けされていますが、それ以外はマップ上にランダムに配置されます。"

#: simulation/data/settings/player_placements.json
msgid "Stronghold"
msgstr "要塞"

#: simulation/data/settings/player_placements.json
msgid "Allied players are tightly grouped together."
msgstr "同盟プレイヤーは密にグループ化されています。"

